WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.360 --> 00:00:03.120
(birds tweeting)

00:00:04.860 --> 00:00:06.400
- [Announcer] Rapidly growing,

00:00:07.620 --> 00:00:08.593
consuming,

00:00:09.630 --> 00:00:10.463
adapting,

00:00:11.950 --> 00:00:12.823
they conquer.

00:00:15.020 --> 00:00:16.573
Jeopardizing local economies,

00:00:17.680 --> 00:00:22.623
threatening human health, and
devastating entire ecosystems.

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:28.600
- [Man] As whole rows of
cherished landmarks are condemned

00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:30.460
brought home to town-dwelling citizens

00:00:30.460 --> 00:00:32.180
are the rigid precautions being taken

00:00:32.180 --> 00:00:33.800
by the Department of Agriculture

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.573
to save this tree from extinction.

00:00:36.530 --> 00:00:37.860
- [Announcer] Invasive species

00:00:37.860 --> 00:00:39.640
are non-native organisms

00:00:39.640 --> 00:00:41.530
that cause considerable damage

00:00:41.530 --> 00:00:44.380
when introduced to a new area.

00:00:44.380 --> 00:00:48.390
These species compete with
native wildlife for resources,

00:00:48.390 --> 00:00:51.899
and thrive at the expense
of the local ecosystem.

00:00:51.899 --> 00:00:54.566
(tree crashing)

00:00:55.510 --> 00:00:57.650
The introduction of invasive species

00:00:57.650 --> 00:01:00.750
is often associated with human activity.

00:01:00.750 --> 00:01:03.450
Boats that travel between
different bodies of water

00:01:03.450 --> 00:01:07.480
can carry hitchhikers,
such as the zebra mussel.

00:01:07.480 --> 00:01:09.740
One of the most notorious invasive species

00:01:09.740 --> 00:01:13.220
in the United States, these
rapidly reproducing mussels

00:01:13.220 --> 00:01:16.963
clog pipes and over take
beaches in the Great Lakes.

00:01:19.610 --> 00:01:21.710
Some invasive species, however,

00:01:21.710 --> 00:01:23.903
are introduced intentionally.

00:01:23.903 --> 00:01:25.350
(frog croaking)

00:01:25.350 --> 00:01:27.280
In the early 20th century,

00:01:27.280 --> 00:01:29.160
cane toads were brought to Australia

00:01:29.160 --> 00:01:31.530
as a form of pest control.

00:01:31.530 --> 00:01:35.830
Today, these poisonous
amphibians number in the millions

00:01:35.830 --> 00:01:39.373
and have cause a decline in
native predators on the island.

00:01:40.720 --> 00:01:42.610
It's not just animals.

00:01:42.610 --> 00:01:46.953
Bacteria, fungi, and plants
can also become invasive.

00:01:48.900 --> 00:01:51.710
Brought to South Africa
in the 19th century,

00:01:51.710 --> 00:01:54.130
the black wattle is an invasive tree

00:01:54.130 --> 00:01:57.080
often used for timber and firewood.

00:01:57.080 --> 00:02:00.080
This beautiful tree, and
other thirsty invasives,

00:02:00.080 --> 00:02:04.163
are depleting the country's
already record-low water supply.

00:02:05.840 --> 00:02:08.240
Because of their impact on human health,

00:02:08.240 --> 00:02:11.060
ecosystems, and infrastructure,

00:02:11.060 --> 00:02:13.960
invasive species cost the global economy

00:02:13.960 --> 00:02:16.653
over a trillion dollars each year.

00:02:19.900 --> 00:02:21.490
Many measures can be taken

00:02:21.490 --> 00:02:24.350
to help limit the spread
of invasive species,

00:02:24.350 --> 00:02:27.353
but the most effective
method is prevention.

00:02:29.170 --> 00:02:30.630
By carefully cleaning boats

00:02:30.630 --> 00:02:34.030
before transferring between
different bodies of water,

00:02:34.030 --> 00:02:36.740
not releasing exotic pets into the wild,

00:02:36.740 --> 00:02:39.950
and planting gardens with native species,

00:02:39.950 --> 00:02:43.483
we can help prevent the
spread of invasive organisms.

00:02:46.600 --> 00:02:48.430
Every living thing has evolved

00:02:48.430 --> 00:02:51.643
to play a specialized role
within their ecosystem.

00:02:52.720 --> 00:02:56.370
In the ultimate balancing
act, even one invasive species

00:02:56.370 --> 00:02:58.563
can drastically tilt the scales.

00:02:59.960 --> 00:03:01.750
If we stay mindful of our role

00:03:01.750 --> 00:03:04.050
in the spread of these organisms,

00:03:04.050 --> 00:03:07.063
we can prevent invasions
before it is too late.

00:03:08.327 --> 00:03:11.744
(gentle cinematic music)

